  "description": "With the extra dose of ”vitamin E”, every ride becomes an experience - for years to come. Thanks to its sophisticated frame geometry, the Tokee EVO SX is ideal for adolescents between 135 and 165 cm tall and therefore offers a particularly long service life.\nWhether it's the daily school run, exciting trails or tours with the adults - with the Tokee EVO SX, you can enjoy maximum e-mountainbike riding fun and full energy both on and off-road.\n\nWith the compact and powerful Bosch Performance Line SX drive, the E-MTB is very light and provides a dynamic, natural riding experience. And the e-MTB for children and teenagers also offers everything you need for robust off-road tours: a robust air suspension fork, powerful hydraulic brakes and grippy Schwalbe Smart Sam Performance tyres.\n\nMonkeyLink Twinlight rear lights are integrated into the dropout for the necessary safety on all routes and paths. And you can quickly and easily attach a front light or charge your smartphone to the MonkeyLink 2.0 interface on the handlebars. So young e-mountain bikers are safe wherever they go!",
